# Document upload conventions

- Keep `FileInterceptor('arquivo')` in `src/documentos/documentos.controller.ts`.
- Enforce the `5 * 1024 * 1024` limit in `src/documentos/documentos.module.ts`.
- Pass `Express.Multer.File` into `src/documentos/documentos.service.ts`.
- Persist document metadata with the related `processoId`.